1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,520
M1: Dave, hasn't the shipment of computer monitors gone out to the electronics shops yet?

2
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:07,580
M2: The truck left here five minutes ago, Mr. Curtis.

3
00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:08,800
Why do you ask?

4
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:17,040
M1: I just received a call from Mr. Brown, the manager of the Bad Boys Electronics Store, and he said that he was in a hurry to receive the goods.

5
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:21,800
I think you'd better call the truck driver and ask him to drop by there first.

6
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:23,765
M2: I don't think I have to do that.

7
00:00:24,180 --> 00:00:27,375
As far as I am concerned, Bad Boys is first on his list.
